WEBVTT

00:09:59.011 --> 00:10:01.305
and demands action from all of us.

00:10:02.348 --> 00:10:03.766
Just for one moment,

00:10:03.807 --> 00:10:05.934
go back to that high school cafeteria,

00:10:05.976 --> 00:10:10.314
But this time you sit down
with that other crowd.

00:10:10.356 --> 00:10:14.109
The kids who didn't look
or think like you do.

00:10:14.777 --> 00:10:17.696
And just imagine
what you could have learned.

00:10:17.696 --> 00:10:18.864
Thank you.

00:10:18.864 --> 00:10:22.201
(Applause)